{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:58 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"璀璨之城丨蔣家旻被蔡一智狂毆至毀容 認執二攤演出  富家女Celia原本由前港姐飾演？\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c04ca4a637c066e5dce22c3212bfdde4/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_1__36.png\"/>\n<p>TVB 台慶劇《璀璨之城》昨晚（29日）播出的一集，湯信義（蔡一智飾）發現 Celia（蔣家旻飾）背著弟弟 Felix（周志康飾）偷食後，一怒之下以鐵板及酒杯狂毆，令蔣家旻慘遭毀容。蔡一智昨晚單是這一幕演出已相當精彩，談到這場狂毆戲，蔡一智坦言事前與蔣家旻反覆試位多次，並透露拍攝時其實非常緊張：「因為我第一次拍呢啲戲，如果整親女仔塊面簡直係滔天大罪。」</p>\n<h2>蔣家旻不介意執二攤</h2>\n<p>今次蔣家旻飾演富家千金 Celia 的演出大受讚賞，原來今次是「執二攤」的演出。最初角色屬意由《2021香港小姐競選》季軍邵初飾演，但最後落在蔣家旻身上。為此，蔣家旻大方表示：「我唔介意呀，之前監製同導演都有同我講過，但係乜嘢原因唔清楚，今次卡士好勁，我有份做已經好開心。」</p>\n<img alt=\"蔡一智首演暴怒老粗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fea06b005d8b327df93574b414928439/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-25_44_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原本信義已為Celia遲到兼擺款大感怒氣，但為畀面細佬決定息事寧人\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cda70e64b05864b85fcd8dd623d0a851/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-25_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"湯信義發現Celia背著細佬Felix（周志康飾）偷食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15a7d025eb5276e1451b332d0fbcc8db/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-25_53_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"為了好好教訓弟婦，信義先是強忍怒火笑住引Celia埋身：「你過一過嚟」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/12b97c6011997bdf59404c29a13e6815/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"信義一手撳蔣家旻塊面去鐵板。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dad3c5db7e085d2e24fb3d74a40d333f/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Felix（周志康飾）反應唔切。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa59f0b04f105381363531cee6805b8e/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_14_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"令Celia慘遭毁容\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e8630458d0bb835b826db0d1ab2fc1b/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"再用酒杯向Celia發動攻擊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72a90fb1b43dbe0cd58afdb18f47cfe8/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃子恆即刻阻止。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d4ce778a8c8a695dd2a53335468d095/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不過亦被蔡一智爆樽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c21367b474bc2f705eac13116beefdc4/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃子恆受傷倒地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d0969808692fc25517bade7c0ed8fd1/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"最初Felix（周志康飾）不知發生乜事。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e976c3c9f0c3c64bde837ebb4f05354/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Felix（周志康飾）終發現老婆偷食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d42389f4d343d668eadc7a093a653ad1/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-26_38_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Celia慘遭毁容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dcac17e2a7cdf3410a5441b2319b24d9/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-31_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Celia不敢報警。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/933b3b2e50948c9ed9cbc85b0284795e/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-31_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Celia慘遭毁容後向老公道歉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24e622be0dd71a3b22a9a572907df9ee/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-31_35_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Felix（周志康飾）忍不住出手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65fa165aee6e19b90c9c097cf51e2a02/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-31_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Celia被打到飛起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5396a9d86d5a8147cb6729fc330f4de9/2026-10/VS--14--myTVSUPER-31_43_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>張智霖記性好 蔣家旻：集郵成功</h2>\n<p>蔣家旻稱當日收到劇本後，很快就試了造型和開拍，不過拍了一個星期後突然需要調整，所以停拍了一個月。蔣家旻稱初入行時第一次拍劇是與袁詠儀合作《疑情別戀》，今次在《璀璨之城》則與張智霖（Chilam）合作，張智霖更記得她曾與其太太合作過，讓她感覺「集郵成功」。今次是蔣家旻在 TVB 的最後一套存貨劇集，目前暫時沒有新劇安排：「我同公司仲有合約，所以唔緊要，等公司安排，而家我努力經營社交媒體，明白市道唔係特別好，好感恩依然有收到工作邀請。」</p>\n<h2>蔡一智拍完狂對蔣家旻和黃子恆道歉</h2>\n<p>談到今次的演出，蔡一智說：「我哋真係試咗好多次位，加上現場有武術指導，所以我哋係 make sure 好安全嘅情況下先埋位拍。」蔡一智又笑言拍攝時有不斷向蔣家旻和黃子恆 Say Sorry 兼人格保證：「因為我同劇組好多男女演員其實都唔太熟，所以每拍完一個鏡頭，我都要同對方強調一次『我平時真係唔係咁嘅人』，驚佢哋誤會以為我咁惡。」阿智又直言角色有挑戰性：「我私下好少咁粗魯，尤其係對女士，今次角色做盡一切我平時唔會做嘅嘢，我覺得畀到觀眾新鮮感。」</p>\n<img alt=\"蔣家旻飾官家大小姐官詩雅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ca586181c512c976836d5b811e4d51d4/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-7_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃子恆偷食人妻蔣家旻兼上演鴛鴦浴戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7555dc2e97c76d935126c537f5a2262/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-7_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"家旻和黃子恆成功擠身尚利鋒的核心管理層後，忍不住「開房慶祝」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8847aad8db273d031617ea8b30ed889b/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-7_40_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔣家旻先脫去衣服露出白滑玉背\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3f597fc258339669d343537bd0ac359/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-7_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔣家旻的白滑玉背當然吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2bf5f4e3a21303de71b2a95f802fe232/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-7_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔣家旻一步一步行入浴缸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d483d7d632de218f3e334d8b1aea6e83/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-7_53_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"畫面充滿遐想。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2d475649966b6c049895a50aecf1ac53/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-7_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃子恆一臉期待。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c3c63ca1fc62db8c05f692514f0cf63/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-7_57_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔣家旻與黃子恆赤裎相見。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55c9552809004fa7e13b596b850cb573/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-8_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"氛圍極盡誘惑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30aae890c5b75cd1b5af709a339d4e4c/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-8_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"對話中流露出不少的「濃情奸意」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c42c5f073413d0c9f570b1ccb8339745/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-8_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d7ec2909c8ec6115907f37cdaf8656f/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-8_37_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人在泡泡中依偎著。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/28055bfba530d79b3c08be0ef6609270/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-8_59_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔣家旻在姜大衞去世後打算與周志康離婚，正式與黃子恆一起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23e6dc01171efd79cd70f4d9efbf6df7/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-9_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃子恆反問她：「你想我坐Felix個位？定還是你想我頂佢做你老公個位？」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd9a2a78cfe7a0d06759d06d91804b59/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-10_04_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"關係瞬間引爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a6c566d3f723df4b615b3aa849aebfc2/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-10_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原來看似失勢的張智霖暗地進行連番暗黑部署。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c2642cc07ce3a1581bf8eb9d4a60c62/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-14_48_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖以蔣家旻偷情證據逼她出賣吳卓羲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/775566891740e0fa05a292ba377d8f56/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-14_50_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張智霖偷拍蔣家旻和黃子恆上床片段。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45f10067b25d6e1ca0aaa5c57d8769be/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-13_54_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔣家旻和黃子恆相當激烈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/02b743b4a7ff3d2818a24ba28ae7a2ae/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-13_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔣家旻和黃子恆偷食仍有下文。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c201fa749fae129e96e64a5993452ad0/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-13_58_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T10:32:07.822681+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":828,"images":40,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T09:58:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:23:25.350176+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T10:23:25.350176+00:00","content_hash":"a13ae51d14d7ddecfe35c3ef05eca33e1e452d178e04a6870bfb1a99d1f87ea1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}